# Project identity

- `cognitiveos-personal` is the repository's only active implementation project.
- CognitiveOS whitepapers, specifications, conformance assets, and reusable kernel
  code form the architecture/contract layer; they are not a second product backlog.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/governance/PROJECT-IDENTITY.md` before selecting work.
- Select tasks from `docs/plan/PERSONAL-DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md` only.
- For product or architecture work, use `docs/product/personal/` and
  `docs/architecture/personal/` as stable design indexes; neither owns current
  task or Gate status.

# Current facts and writes

- `docs/plan/PROGRESS.md` `Current snapshot` owns current status.
- `docs/plan/PARALLEL-LANES.md` owns active writable leases.
- Handoffs and root `plan.md` are historical/detail sources and cannot override current facts.
- Claim a non-overlapping, exact-path `lease/personal/...` before writing;
  broad protected-tree globs are invalid.
- Deliver a smallest vertical slice; do not replace known implementation work with repeated audits.
- Never read or cite `History/`; never mix `personal-blog/` into this repository.
